sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Input Validator
    participant Auth
    participant RBAC
    participant Action
    
    User->>Input Validator: Request
    Input Validator->>Input Validator: Whitelist Check
    Input Validator->>Auth: Validated Input
    Auth->>Auth: Verify Token
    Auth->>RBAC: Check Permissions
    RBAC->>Action: Execute
    Action->>User: Response
